<div>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-orb"></div>
    <div class="hero-badge"><span class="pulse-dot"></span><span style="position:relative;z-index:1;">Builders & Intermediaries · Monetise — narrow</span></div>
    <h1>Add an address-quality verdict <span class="accent">to every payee check.</span><span class="badge badge-accent" style="margin-left:10px;vertical-align:middle;">Net-new</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A <b>Verification of Payee</b> (EU) or <b>Confirmation of Payee</b> (UK) provider verifies one payee at a time — so ioNova ARS adds a single, high-margin signal: an address-quality verdict returned alongside your name/account match. It’s the narrowest fit of any audience — one API group, pre-check only, <b>sub-100ms</b> — and the smallest integration surface, because you never handle a payment message.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Get a sandbox <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg></a>
      <a href="#implementation" class="btn btn-outline">See the implementation plan</a>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-bar">
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad">sub-100ms</div><div class="kpi-label">address verdict</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad-b">1</div><div class="kpi-label">API group (EP-01–07)</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad-t">days</div><div class="kpi-label">to integrate</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad">0</div><div class="kpi-label">message handling</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="quote-card">
      <div class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
      <div class="quote-text">Our CoP/VOP response is a name-and-account match. We want one more differentiating signal — is the payee’s address structurally sound? — without taking on payment-message handling or a heavy integration.</div>
      <div class="quote-author">The problem, in their words</div>
      <div class="quote-role">Product Lead, Confirmation of Payee API</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">Capabilities</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">What You Can Do</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="g2">
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-teal"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Validate an address on a form</div>
        <div class="card-body">Structural address check, sub-100ms, as the payee is entered.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Validate</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-blue"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Classify & normalise a payee</div>
        <div class="card-body">Detect the format and normalise the address ahead of the name/account match.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Classify→Correct</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-cyan"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Verify inside a CoP/VOP check</div>
        <div class="card-body">Return an address-quality verdict alongside your match result.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Validate</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal" id="implementation">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">Implementation Plan</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">From Sandbox to Live</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="g3" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);">
      <div class="decision-box"><div class="decision-label">Span</div><div class="decision-body">Fastest of all — integrate in days, inside the corporate window</div></div>
      <div class="decision-box"><div class="decision-label">Shape</div><div class="decision-body">Narrowest — one API group, pre-check only, single REST integration</div></div>
      <div class="decision-box"><div class="decision-label">Tier entry</div><div class="decision-body">Business / Corporate</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Get started</div><div class="step-body">Sandbox live, first resolved address in ~2 days</div></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Build</div><div class="step-body">Register channels, test; ioNova tunes ~10,000 representative addresses in parallel</div></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Validate</div><div class="step-body">Production validation — channels + integrations exercised together</div></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">4</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Go live</div><div class="step-body">Swap test keys for live keys — no code change</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);"><p>This is the smallest surface ioNova ships — the Party Address API (EP-01–07) only, no message handling to build or maintain. A single REST integration into your CoP/VOP response path gets you live well inside the corporate window, often in days. Sandbox keys and first resolved address in ~2 days; ioNova calibrates on representative payee addresses in parallel.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">Headline Benefits</div>
