        <span class="badge badge-green">a differentiating signal in your CoP/VOP product</span>
        <span class="badge badge-green">sub-100ms</span>
        <span class="badge badge-green">the smallest integration surface of any audience</span>
        <span class="badge badge-green">no message handling to build or maintain</span>
    </div>
    <div class="alert alert-green" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);">
      <div class="alert-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7z"/></svg></div>
      <div class="alert-content">
        <div class="alert-title">Where you start</div>
        <div class="alert-body">Business or Corporate tier — data-scope only.</div>
